        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At first, the people of the whole world had only one language and used the same words. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As they wandered about in the East, they came to a plain in Babylonia and settled there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They said to one another, “Come on! Let's make bricks and bake them hard.” So they had bricks to build with and tar to hold them together. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They said, “Now let's build a city with a tower that reaches the sky, so that we can make a name for ourselves and not be scattered all over the earth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came down to see the city and the tower which those men had built, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he said, “Now then, these are all one people and they speak one language; this is just the beginning of what they are going to do. Soon they will be able to do anything they want! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us go down and mix up their language so that they will not understand one another.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " scattered them all over the earth, and they stopped building the city. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The city was called Babylon,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Babylon",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name sounds like the Hebrew for “mixed up”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " because there the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mixed up the language of all the people, and from there he scattered them all over the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
